# Blazor UI

- Components live under `src/PokeHex.UI`. Prefer small focused components per section (Inicio, Equipo, Cajas, Editor, etc.).
- Inject services from `PokeHex.Services`; do not call `SaveUtil` / PKHeX types directly from markup when a facade exists.
- CSS variables for brand colors in shared stylesheet. Expressive fonts via Google Fonts or bundled woff (not Inter/Roboto/Arial/system-only).
- Keep first viewport of Inicio uncluttered: brand, short sentence, open/save CTA, dropzone.
- All user-facing strings in Spanish.
